    "text": "KHQ Right Now\nwebsite\nOkanogan County, Washington\nApple Acres Fire grows to 2,000 acres, triggers evacuations and Highway 97 closure in Chelan and Okanogan Counties\nBy Daniel Fortin NonStop Local Digital Journalist,\n4 hours agoCHELAN COUNTY, Wash. – Chelan County Emergency Management has issued a Level 2 (Be Set) evacuation notice for the Apple Acres Fire. According to the Washington State Patrol (WSP), Highway 97 is closed in both directions from Milepost 240 in Chelan County to Milepost 255 in Okanogan County due to a fast-moving wildfire.\n6",
